# Backend API

- Feature = `module.ts` + `service.ts` + `controller.ts` (if HTTP) + `index.ts` (Module + exported providers for consumers)
- `AppModule` imports Modules only, not Services
- Controller → Service → `@portfolio/domain` (thin wiring)
- Cross-feature via `@Module({ imports, exports })`
- Package public API: `03-public-api.md`; MCP: `04-mcp-stack.md`

See `skills/rules/08-backend-api.md`.
